Z||000004||Fierowrecker||10-21-2001||09:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by WampusCat:<BR><B>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/avex-rivet.gif">  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That is assuming it is a "pop" rivit gun...<BR>If it is the aircraft type, then there is no nail...<BR>And it uses air...<BR>crash...||||reg||1
Z||000005||WampusCat||10-21-2001||11:10 PM||||Or if it looks like this: <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/squezers.gif"> <BR>It uses leverage to squeeze a solid rivet instead of an air rivet driver and a bucking bar.||||reg||1
